  "text": "proprium.sancti-marci-evangelistae-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Saint Mark the Evangelist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "May thy holy mysteries, we ask, O Lord, be to us a continual safeguard, and through the prayers of blessed Mark, thy Evangelist, ever defend us from all adversities. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
  },
